---METADATA---
TARGET: packages/nextjs/scaffold.config.ts
DESCRIPTION: Update scaffold config to use Flow EVM testnet
DEPENDENCIES: 01-custom-chains.prompt
PRIORITY: high
---END_METADATA---

Update the existing scaffold.config.ts file to use Flow EVM testnet as the target network.

Requirements:
- Import `flowTestnet` from "./utils/customChains"
- Update the `targetNetworks` array to include only `flowTestnet`
- Keep all other configuration options as they are
- Maintain proper TypeScript types with `as const satisfies ScaffoldConfig`

Example structure:
```typescript
import { flowTestnet } from "./utils/customChains";

const scaffoldConfig = {
  targetNetworks: [flowTestnet],
  pollingInterval: 30000,
  // ... other existing config
} as const satisfies ScaffoldConfig;
```

DO NOT remove any existing configuration options. Only update the targetNetworks.
